	(text "J3 = baseboard J11 (2x19 1.27 mm socket on B.Cu, pin n = baseboard pin n, see MECHANICAL.md).\nNets = sheet-11 names (bank 34, 3.3 V, no translators). Every digital pin has a 10 k pull-down: with PUDC_B\nhigh the PL has no pull-ups while unconfigured, so the baseboard sees low (J3 safe state). isoada1-3: analog, to the mux."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 17.78 0)
		(effects
