	(text "J2: UART console (PS UART1, MIO48 TX / MIO49 RX, 1.8 V), family pinout 1 RX, 2 TX, 3 GND at 3.3 V.\nU1301 SN74AVC4T774RSVR (C779392), per-bit direction: A = J2 side (3V3), B = MIO side (1V8).\nDIR1 = H: J2 RX A1 -> B1; DIR2 = L: TX B2 -> A2; bits 3/4 unused (DIR H, A3/A4 to GND). OE low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 172.72 0)
